Live on your management cluster: ingress-nginx, kyverno. Each variant's profile deploys the same add-ons to the same cluster, and Sveltos lets one profile manage a release at a time, so the per-cluster profiles wait until the live one steps aside. apply also writes takeover.sh, which hands each release over without reinstalling it; run it after apply.sh. See "Taking over from live profiles" in docs/user/onboard-your-sveltos-fleet.md.

Next: npm run onboard -- apply <the same input and options> --out <dir>, read <dir>/apply.sh, then run it.

